      <h2>What is {{ config.siteName }}?</h2>
      <p>{{ config.siteName }} is a free online developer tools platform. Our tools cover <strong>code formatting</strong>, <strong>data encoding/decoding</strong>, <strong>hashing</strong>, <strong>text processing</strong>, and more. All tools run locally in your browser — no installation required.</p>

      <h2>Our Principles</h2>

      <h3>Privacy First</h3>
      <p>All computations happen in your browser. Your data is never sent to any server. This means:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Your code is never exposed to third parties</li>
        <li>Your data is never recorded or stored</li>
        <li>Even if the website goes down, your data remains safe</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>100% Free</h3>
      <p>We believe essential developer tools should be freely accessible. All tools are completely free with no registration required and no usage limits.</p>

      <h3>Lightning Fast</h3>
      <p>Built as a static site and deployed on a global CDN. Fast load times and smooth experience, no matter where you are.</p>

      <h3>Continuously Improved</h3>
      <p>We listen to user feedback and constantly add new tools and improve existing ones. If you have suggestions, feel free to contact us.</p>

      <h2>Technology Stack</h2>
      <p>Built with modern technologies:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Static Site Generator:</strong> Eleventy (11ty), lightweight and efficient.</li>
        <li><strong>Global Deployment:</strong> Cloudflare Pages with global CDN for fast access worldwide.</li>
        <li><strong>Frontend:</strong> Pure HTML/CSS/JavaScript, no framework dependencies, optimal performance.</li>
        <li><strong>Privacy:</strong> All data processing happens client-side, zero backend dependency.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Available Tools</h2>
