        <li><strong>Hashing:</strong> MD5 generator for quick data checksums.</li>
        <li><strong>Text Processing:</strong> Regex tester for debugging regular expressions.</li>
        <li><strong>Generators:</strong> UUID generator, timestamp converter, and other utilities.</li>
